    "detailed_description": "<h1>Now Released</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234770/extras/ea32121a7a16b86f4c644a0bed8d50ce.webp?t=1742949931\" /></span> New game from 4noki<br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>A private investigator visits a small town after recovering from a coma. She searches for her mentor's lost beloved, but the very eyes she was born with, those that can see the black strings of hate, drag her down into the darkness of conspiracy.<br><br><br>A cult, two priestesses, and the threads that puppet the world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>~45k words<br></li><li>4 major endings and plenty of dead ends<br></li><li>10 CGs<br></li><li>12 original tracks<br></li><li>Accessibility options<br></li><li>Steam achievements (Steam version)</li></ul>",
